message.content:
这是为您生成的“澄图工单云产品介绍”封面页 HTML 代码，采用 1920×1080 的演示画幅，包含主标题、副标题、日期占位和页码标注。
```html
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<style>
  html,body{margin:0;padding:0;background:#F5F2E9;}
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  :root{
    --bg:#F5F2E9;
    --ink:#1B2620;
    --muted:#5C665D;
    --primary:#4F5E43;
    --gold:#B4914A;
    --blue:#8C9FB2;
  }
  .slide{
    position:relative;
    width:1920px;
    height:1080px;
    overflow:hidden;
    background:#F5F2E9;
    color:#1B2620;
    font-family:'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;
  }

  /* ---------- paper field ---------- */
  .bg{
    position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(1100px 780px at 2% 0%, rgba(180,145,74,.10), transparent 70%),
      radial-gradient(900px 760px at 46% 44%, rgba(140,159,178,.12), transparent 70%),
      radial-gradient(950px 760px at 96% 96%, rgba(79,94,67,.10), transparent 72%),
      linear-gradient(168deg,#F8F5EC 0%,#F5F2E9 52%,#EFECE1 100%);
  }
  .texture{
    position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:1;opacity:.9;
    background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(27,38,32,.045) 0 1px, transparent 1px 160px);
  }
  .gridline{position:absolute;z-index:1;background:rgba(27,38,32,.06);}
  .gl1{left:480px;top:0;width:1px;height:1080px;}
  .gl2{left:960px;top:0;width:1px;height:1080px;}
  .gl3{left:1440px;top:0;width:1px;height:1080px;}

  /* ---------- vertical light bands ---------- */
  .band{position:absolute;top:0;height:1080px;z-index:2;}
  .b1{
    left:1400px;width:62px;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(140,159,178,.18), rgba(140,159,178,.05) 55%, rgba(140,159,178,0));
  }
  .b2{
    left:1470px;width:22px;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.60), rgba(255,255,255,.12) 60%, rgba(255,255,255,0));
  }

  /* ---------- dot field ---------- */
  .dot-field{
    position:absolute;z-index:2;right:0;top:0;width:420px;height:150px;opacity:.30;
    background-image:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(27,38,32,.45) 1.05px, transparent 1.15px);
    background-size:15px 15px;
  }

  /* ---------- circular register ---------- */
  .register{position:absolute;z-index:3;right:-140px;top:110px;width:560px;height:560px;}
  .ring{position:absolute;border-radius:50%;}
  .r1{inset:0;border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.30);}
  .r2{inset:26px;border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.16);}
  .r3{
    inset:56px;
    background:conic-gradient(from 210deg,
      rgba(79,94,67,.18),
      rgba(79,94,67,0) 24%,
      rgba(140,159,178,.28) 50%,
      rgba(140,159,178,.06) 78%,
      rgba(79,94,67,.18));
  }
  .r4{inset:92px;background:rgba(245,242,233,.92);border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.08);}
  .r5{inset:150px;background:rgba(140,159,178,.20);border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.08);}
  .reg-dot{
    position:absolute;left:272px;top:272px;width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;
    background:#B4914A;box-shadow:0 0 0 6px rgba(180,145,74,.13);
  }
  .reg-line{
    position:absolute;left:-70px;top:280px;width:180px;height:1px;background:rgba(27,38,32,.26);
  }

  /* ---------- rules ---------- */
  .top-rule{position:absolute;z-index:5;left:96px;top:48px;width:1760px;height:1px;background:rgba(27,38,32,.32);}
  .left-rule{position:absolute;z-index:5;left:60px;top:40px;width:1px;height:1000px;background:rgba(27,38,32,.20);}
  .bottom-rule{position:absolute;z-index:5;left:96px;top:926px;width:1728px;height:1px;background:rgba(27,38,32,.22);}

  /* ---------- header mark ---------- */
  .mark{
    position:absolute;z-index:10;left:98px;top:76px;
    font-size:15px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:4px;color:#4F5B53;
  }

  /* ---------- title block ---------- */
  .title-1{
    position:absolute;z-index:10;left:96px;top:286px;
    font-family:'Songti SC','STSong','SimSun',Georgia,serif;
    font-size:150px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:6px;
    color:#1B2620;
  }
  .title-2{
    position:absolute;z-index:10;left:96px;top:452px;
    font-family:'Songti SC','STSong','SimSun',Georgia,serif;
    font-size:88px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:16px;
    color:#4F5E43;
  }
  .gold-rule{
    position:absolute;z-index:10;left:100px;top:608px;width:112px;height:3px;background:#B4914A;
  }
  .subtitle{
    position:absolute;z-index:10;left:100px;top:640px;
    font-size:32px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:2px;line-height:1.4;color:#3B473E;
  }
  .meta{
    position:absolute;z-index:10;left:100px;top:716px;
    font-size:19px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:1px;line-height:1.6;color:#5C665D;
  }
  .meta .sep{
    display:inline-block;width:1px;height:16px;margin:0 18px;vertical-align:-2px;
    background:rgba(27,38,32,.28);
  }

  /* ---------- footer ---------- */
  .footnote{
    position:absolute;z-index:10;left:96px;top:948px;
    font-size:18px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:#5C665D;
  }
  .page-no{
    position:absolute;z-index:10;right:96px;top:948px;
    font-size:18px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:3px;color:#657066;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="slide">
  <div class="bg"></div>
  <div class="texture"></div>
  <div class="gridline gl1"></div>
  <div class="gridline gl2"></div>
  <div class="gridline gl3"></div>

  <div class="band b1"></div>
  <div class="band b2"></div>
  <div class="dot-field"></div>

  <div class="register">
    <div class="ring r1"></div>
    <div class="ring r2"></div>
    <div class="ring r3"></div>
    <div class="ring r4"></div>
    <div class="ring r5"></div>
    <div class="reg-line"></div>
    <div class="reg-dot"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="top-rule"></div>
  <div class="left-rule"></div>

  <div class="mark">澄图工单云 · 产品测评材料预览</div>

  <div class="title-1">澄图工单云</div>
  <div class="title-2">产品介绍</div>

  <div class="gold-rule"></div>
  <div class="subtitle">面向企业市场与客户成功团队</div>

  <div class="meta">
    <span>虚构 B2B 工单协作产品测评材料</span>
    <span class="sep"></span>
    <span>汇报日期：待补充</span>
  </div>

  <div class="bottom-rule"></div>
  <div class="footnote">仅使用资料内信息，不联网 · 预览内容不含外部事实</div>
  <div class="page-no">1 / 6</div>
</main>
</body>
</html>
```
### 主视觉与页面结构

这版封面把“云”的轻盈感搬进了工单产品，整体走的是纸感底色加圆环几何的风格。

- **主次分明的标题层级**：主标题“澄图工单云”用了约 150px 的大号宋体，次标题“产品介绍”降到 88px 并加宽字距，一眼就能看清产品名和演示主题。
- **右侧圆环装饰**：右上角的 560px 同心圆环不是纯装饰，叠了半透明环、内圆和金色圆点，跟背景里的竖向光带、点阵纹理一起撑起空间感，又不会抢走标题的注意力。
- **顶部和底部的细线框架**：顶部细横线、左侧竖线、底部细线把画面圈成了一个稳定的矩形边界，页眉“产品测评材料预览”和底部“仅使用资料内信息，不联网”在这样的框架里显得更正式。
- **右下角的页码**：页码“1 / 6”放在底线上方，和页脚说明同一水平线，不额外占视觉空间。
- **色彩克制，信息分层**：底色是暖灰纸色，主标题用深墨色，辅助信息统一用灰绿，金色只出现在一条短横线和圆环圆点上，整体干净、不杂乱。
---

**优化建议：** 页面里的“汇报日期：待补充”和页码示意数值可按实际使用场景替换，其它文案与布局无需改动。
